sion rate of 1.95583 BGN = 1 EUR.  Data for Bulgaria are included in aggregates for the Euro Area from April 1, 2026, for all periods from January 1, 2026, onwards." KEYWORDS_DATASET="International Reserves;Foreign Currency Liquidity;IRFCL;Reserves Data Template;Reserves Template;reserve assets;reserves;official reserves;official foreign currency assets" FULL_DESCRIPTION="The International Reserves and Foreign Currency Liquidity dataset (Reserves Data Template) includes the country's reserve assets and other foreign currency assets. It also includes scheduled outflows and inflows of those assets, contingent assets/liabilities, and other information on international reserves and foreign currency liquidity statistics by economy. The data present a comprehensive account of official foreign currency assets with scheduled and contingent outflows and inflows of those assets, providing essential inforfmation to measure net internatioanl reserves and assess the external vulnerability of the country. Data are collected from national authorites using the IMF Data Template on International Reserves and Foreign Currency Liquidity." LICENSE="© International Monetary Fund Copyright. All Rights Reserved. https://www.imf.org/external/terms.htm"><Series COUNTRY="AGO" INDICATOR="IRFCLDT1_IRFCL56V_FTO" SECTOR="S1XS1311" FREQUENCY="M" SCALE="6" METHODOLOGY="IRFCL13" ACCESS_SHARING_LEVEL="PUBLIC_OPEN" SECURITY_CLASSIFICATION="PUB"><Obs TIME_PERIOD="2026-M07" OBS_VALUE="592900000" DERIVATION_TYPE="O"/><Obs TIME_PERIOD="2026-M08" OBS_VALUE="592900000" DERIVATION_TYPE="O"/><Obs TIME_PERIOD="2026-M09" OBS_VALUE="592900000" DERIVATION_TYPE="O"/></Series><Series COUNTRY="BEL" INDICATOR="IRFCLDT1_IRFCL56V_FTO" SECTOR="S1311" FREQUENCY="M" SCALE="6" METHODOLOGY="IRFCL13" ACCESS_SHARING_LEVEL="PUBLIC_OPEN" SECURITY_CLASSIFICATION="PUB"><Obs TIME_PERIOD="2026-M07" OBS_VALUE="0" DERIVATION_TYPE="O"/><Obs TIME_PERIOD="2026-M08" OBS_VALUE="0" DERIVATION_TYPE="O"/><Obs TIME_PERIOD="2026-M09" OBS_VALU